                                                "text": "A new type of fouling point indicator is being tried out by the London Transport Executive. Until now the standard method of indicating the point nearest to a junction of two stabling roads where a train can stand without fouling the adjacent road has been by fixing the letters \"FP\" [fouling point] to the sleepers of the road concerned."
